{"unit_id":"drshy-org__lightroom-py#feature-1","repo":"drshy-org/lightroom-py","commit":"cb5b0d9daf73db407e6ccbc8a46eb4153d783ce1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lightroom-py 的功能「browse」：列出活动目录中的照片并按评分、相机、镜头、关键词和日期筛选，返回照片标识及基本信息。 通过 MCP 工具调用触发，输入筛选条件、照片 UUID 或编辑参数，返回查询结果或操作结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/lightroom/mcp_server.py:54-76"]}
{"unit_id":"drshy-org__lightroom-py#feature-2","repo":"drshy-org/lightroom-py","commit":"cb5b0d9daf73db407e6ccbc8a46eb4153d783ce1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lightroom-py 的功能「metadata」：设置照片关键词、星级、颜色标签和 IPTC 元数据，可按 UUID 指定照片。 通过 MCP 工具调用触发，输入筛选条件、照片 UUID 或编辑参数，返回查询结果或操作结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/lightroom/mcp_server.py:77-117"]}
{"unit_id":"drshy-org__lightroom-py#feature-3","repo":"drshy-org/lightroom-py","commit":"cb5b0d9daf73db407e6ccbc8a46eb4153d783ce1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lightroom-py 的功能「develop」：查看预设并对照片应用预设或显影参数，也可将显影设置重置为相机默认值。 通过 MCP 工具调用触发，输入筛选条件、照片 UUID 或编辑参数，返回查询结果或操作结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/lightroom/mcp_server.py:118-159"]}
{"unit_id":"drshy-org__lightroom-py#feature-4","repo":"drshy-org/lightroom-py","commit":"cb5b0d9daf73db407e6ccbc8a46eb4153d783ce1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lightroom-py 的功能「export」：将照片导出为 TIFF、JPEG、PSD、DNG 或原始格式，并设置质量与色彩空间。 通过 MCP 工具调用触发，输入筛选条件、照片 UUID 或编辑参数，返回查询结果或操作结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/lightroom/mcp_server.py:173-190"]}
